error[RB0128]: `A.Last` is a history state, which `in(…)` cannot name
 --> RB0128-in-history-or-choice.road:8:29
  |
8 |     state X { on Go if in(A.Last) -> Pick }
  |                             ^^^^
  |
  = help: a history state is never active, only a target that returns to where `A` was; name `A` or one of its children

error[RB0128]: `Pick` is a choice state, which `in(…)` cannot name
  --> RB0128-in-history-or-choice.road:11:11
   |
11 |     if in(Pick) -> A
   |           ^^^^
   |
   = help: a run never rests in a choice: it leaves it in the same step; name the states its branches go to
